## Worker Heartbeats Outside This Schedule

Operator, Chronicle Harvester, and Codex Session Harvester are separate persistent worker threads once setup has their thread ids and selected heartbeats. Their prompts live in [[Operations/worker-prompts/operator.md]], [[Operations/worker-prompts/chronicle-harvester.md]], and [[Operations/worker-prompts/codex-session-harvester.md]]. Do not run them as scheduler tasks in this CoS dispatcher.

## Automation Notes

This file owns due logic. Codex Desktop automations own wake-up timing. If no Codex automation is configured yet, ask Codex manually for `RUN SCHEDULER` from this workspace until setup creates the real heartbeat.
